Package: sweep
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Fast, safe, cross-platform system cleaner
 Sweep is a BleachBit-inspired system and privacy cleaner written in Rust.
 It cleans package caches, old kernels, journals, user caches, Snap/Flatpak/
 Docker leftovers and more, with dry-run previews, keep-list guards,
 per-category size reports and operation logging.
